 "sentences": [
  "Cholangiocarcinoma forms directly inside your bile ducts.",
  "Symptoms include abdominal pain, yellowish skin, and fever.",
  "Patients might also notice weight loss, itching, or dark urine.",
  "Risk factors include cirrhosis, hepatitis B or C, and ulcerative colitis.",
  "Most people have no identifiable risk factors at all.",
  "Diagnosis requires examining tumor cells under a microscope.",
  "It is typically incurable when first detected."
